@startuml
title Stock-based delivery

participant "EngagementManagement" as EM #magenta
box "Service Provider"
  participant "ProductOrderOrchestrationManagement" as POOM
  participant "SupplyChainManagement" as SCM #blue
  participant "EventManagement" as Event
  participant "ProductOrderCaptureValidation" as POCV
  participant "ProductInventory" as PI
end box
box "Logistic Partner"
  participant "P_SupChainMgmt" as PSCM #blue
end box
box "Delivery Partner"
  participant "D_SupChainMgmt" as DSCM #blue
end box

== Following shipment tracking ==

note over EM : user wants to knows where is the shipment

EM -> POCV : 120 **TMF622 Product Ordering** GET /productOrder\n(relatedParty.id&role, state)
activate POCV
POCV --> EM : 121 **TMF622** 200 OK\nget list of product order
deactivate POCV

EM -> SCM : 122 **TMF700 Shipping Order** GET /shippingOrder\n(relatedProductOrder)
activate SCM
SCM --> EM : 123 **TMF700** 200 OK\nget shippingOrder with supply chain partner & id
deactivate SCM

EM -> PSCM : 124 **TMF700 Shipping Order** GET /shippingOrder\n(relatedProductOrder)
activate PSCM
PSCM --> EM : 125 **TMF700** 200 OK\nget shippingOrder with shipment partner & id
deactivate PSCM

EM -> DSCM : 126 **TMF684 Shipment Tracking - HISTORIC API** GET shipmentTracking\n(order.id={id})
activate DSCM
DSCM --> EM : 127 **TMF684** 200 OK - details with carrier tracking Url
deactivate DSCM

EM -> EM : 128 Display carrier shipment follow-up UI

== Later....once the box has been delivery to the customer ==

DSCM -> PSCM : 129 Event for Shipment State change (completed)
PSCM -> SCM : 130 Event for shippingOrder state change (completed)
activate SCM

SCM -> POOM : 131 Notification for shippingOrder state change (completed)
SCM -> SCM : 132 PATCH ShippingOrder #26
SCM -> Event : 133 Event for ShippingOrder/ShippingOrderItem state change

Event --> POOM : 134 Notification for ShippingOrder/ShippingOrderItem state change
deactivate SCM
activate POOM
POOM --> POOM : 135 update delivery flow
POOM --> PI : 136 **TMF637 Product Inventory Management** PATCH /product/id1 (state update)
POOM --> POCV : 137 **TMF622 Product Ordering** PATCH ProductOrder (state item update)

note over POOM : Back to global flow view
deactivate POOM

@enduml
